Quick rules reminder:

Click a train in Arrivals to select it (it highlights blue)
Click an empty Platform to assign it — platforms auto-clear after ~8 seconds
Trains expire if you don't route them before their TTL bar drains — 5 misses ends the shift
Routing quickly earns a speed bonus; the score penalty for a miss is −15pts
Every 30 seconds the level ticks up: TTLs shrink and trains spawn faster

